{"4907710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Studio zero", "steam_appid": 4907710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio Zero is a first-person, cyberpunk interactive FMV (Full Motion Video) game. Set in a rain-soaked, neon-drenched future ruled by ruthless megacorporations, you will be thrust into a deadly conspiracy involving cybernetic augments, rogue mind-uploads, and underground rebellions. Combining cinematic live-action production with high-stakes branching choices, every decision you make—every trigger pulled or compromise accepted—will dynamically reshape your story. Will you submit to become a soulless corporate asset, rise as a neon martyr to shatter the system, or vanish into the night with your final obsessions? Step into Studio Zero. Beneath the neon, every choice has its price.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907710/extras/cf0e715e9ea3a8d3676085edbe49028a.avif?t=1787827796\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio Zero is a first-person, cyberpunk interactive FMV (Full Motion Video) game. Set in a rain-soaked, neon-drenched future ruled by ruthless megacorporations, you will be thrust into a deadly conspiracy involving cybernetic augments, rogue mind-uploads, and underground rebellions. Combining cinematic live-action production with high-stakes branching choices, every decision you make—every trigger pulled or compromise accepted—will dynamically reshape your story. Will you submit to become a soulless corporate asset, rise as a neon martyr to shatter the system, or vanish into the night with your final obsessions? Step into Studio Zero. Beneath the neon, every choice has its price.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907710/extras/cf0e715e9ea3a8d36760